  "text": "Services\n\nPricing\n\nOur Work\n\nNews & Offers\n\nAbout\n\nTraining\n\nCall Us: +1 206 555 0148\n\nContact Us\n\nOur Work\nSee the Difference\n\nExplore a selection of vehicle transformations and drag each comparison to see the results before and after the work.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nPaint Correction & Ceramic Coating\n\nVEHICLE\n\nBMW M4\n\nDURATION\n\n2 Days\n\nSERVICES\n\nPaint Correction · Ceramic Coating · Wheel Detail\n\nLight swirl marks and surface defects were reducing the clarity of the paint. The finish was corrected to restore gloss before ceramic protection was applied.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nFull Interior Detail\n\nVEHICLE\n\nMercedes-Benz GLC\n\nDURATION\n\n1 Day\n\nSERVICES\n\nInterior Detail · Deep Cleaning · Interior Protection\n\nThe interior received a thorough clean across high-contact surfaces, seats, carpets, and trim to restore a fresher and better-maintained cabin.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nPaint Protection Film\n\nVEHICLE\n\nPorsche Macan\n\nDURATION\n\n3 Days\n\nSERVICES\n\nPaint Preparation · Front-End PPF · Final Inspection\n\nThe front of the vehicle was carefully prepared before paint protection film was installed across key high-impact areas.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nWater Spot Removal & Exterior Detail\n\nVEHICLE\n\nAudi A5\n\nDURATION\n\n1 Day\n\nSERVICES\n\nDetail Wash · Water Spot Removal · Exterior Finish\n\nMineral deposits and surface contamination had reduced the clarity of the finish. The exterior was cleaned and treated to restore a cleaner, more even appearance.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nHeadlight Restoration\n\nVEHICLE\n\nToyota Camry\n\nDURATION\n\nHalf Day\n\nSERVICES\n\nHeadlight Restoration · Surface Refinement · Protection\n\nCloudy and oxidized headlight lenses were restored to improve clarity and give the front of the vehicle a cleaner appearance.\n\nBefore\nAfter\n\nExterior Detail & Paint Enhancement\n\nVEHICLE\n\nTesla Model 3\n\nDURATION\n\n1 Day\n\nSERVICES\n\nDetail Wash · Decontamination · Paint Enhancement\n\nRoad film and light surface imperfections were affecting the finish. A complete exterior detail and paint enhancement brought back a cleaner, glossier appearance.\n\nGive Your Vehicle the Care It Deserves\n\nFrom routine detailing to long-term protection, HyperAuto Care is here to help keep your vehicle looking its best.\n\nContact Us\n\nCall Now\n\nProfessional car care, detailing, paint protection, and vehicle appearance services in Seattle.\n\nHyperAuto Care\n\nHyperAuto Care\n\nNavigation\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nService Process\n\nPricing\n\nOur Work\n\nNews & Offers\n\nAbout\n\nTraining\n\nContact\n\nContact\n\n+1 206 555 0148\n\ncontact@hyperautocare.com\n\n000 Harbor Avenue SW, Suite 120\n\nSeattle, WA 98126\n\nUSA\n\nOpening Hours\n\nMonday - Friday\n\n8:00 AM - 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday\n\n8:00 AM - 12:00 PM\n\nSunday\n\nClosed\n\n© HyperAuto Care. All rights reserved.\n\nDesigned by RedSignal.Red\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nGet Template - Free\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.\n\n ",
